# Elemental's configuration in the Zephyr test image. Zephyr is not the
# POSIX host the io_posix backend and its tests are written for.
# EL_CONFIG_IO_POSIX is not set
# Nor is it the hosted C library the alloc_libc backend is written for.
# EL_CONFIG_ALLOC_LIBC is not set
# Its clock is the kernel's (time_zephyr), not clock_gettime().
# EL_CONFIG_TIME_POSIX is not set
